# PUBCON    Title: Theoretical Energy Levels of 1sns and 1snp States of Helium-Like Ions
# PUBCON  Authors: V. A. Yerokhin and A. Surzhykov
# PUBCON Citation: J. Phys. Chem. Ref. Data 48, 033104 (2019)
